// Pure defaults for the quick-capture sheets (unit-tested in tests/quick-defaults.test.mjs).
// Meal type by Asia/Shanghai local hour:
//   05:00–09:59 早餐 · 10:00–14:59 午餐 · 15:00–16:59 加餐 · 17:00–21:59 晚餐 · 22:00–04:59 加餐
